OL,3,AUS justice department investigates TV
OL,4,Anetworks over Trump pool coverage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US justice department (DoJ) has
OL,7,Fsaid it is investigating several TV
OL,8,Fnetworks over whether they broke
OL,9,Ffederal competition laws when they
OL,10,Frecently suspended pool coverage of
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,13,FLast month, five networks paused their
OL,14,Fpresidential coverage for several days
OL,15,Fin response to the Trump administration
OL,16,Fwithdrawing the credentials of
OL,17,Freporters from CNN, MS Now and
OL,18,FPolitico.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
