OL,3,AUS justice department investigates TV
OL,4,Anetworks over Trump pool coverage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe justice department asked ABC, CBS,
OL,7,FCNN, NBC and Fox News to hand over
OL,8,Fcommunications related to the pool and
OL,9,Fsaid that the boycott could violate the
OL,10,FSherman Act, referring to a law that
OL,11,Fbars companies from engaging in
OL,12,Fmonopolistic business practices.
OL,14,FPool members usually share their
OL,15,Fmaterial with the wider media.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
